      <th>Name
      <th>Type
      <th>Conditions
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><dfn>swap_depth</dfn>
      <td>[=leb128=]
      <td>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h4 id=insn-slice>
Slice instruction</h4>

Opcode 10<sub>16</sub> denotes a **Slice instruction**. Its operands consist of the following:

